  "step_3": "The decision reason requires evaluating the sum of all pairwise differences of outcomes between the lotteries and preferring the one with the more favorable (i.e., higher) sum. The individual does not mention any such calculation or reasoning. Instead, the individual focuses on the chance of avoiding a loss, which is a different consideration—specifically, the probability of receiving 0 euros (i.e., no loss) rather than the sum of outcome differences. The information considered by the individual (avoiding loss) is not equivalent to the information required by the decision reason (sum of pairwise outcome differences). Moreover, the justification provided (avoiding loss) does not reflect the rule of the decision reason. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The reasoning is qualitatively different and not aligned with the specified rule. Hence, the decision reason was not used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
